es feature a stepped shaft design combined with a non-slip grip that greatly reduces vibration and provides accurate feedback at impact. This ensures you feel confident with every swing<div></div>  - MICRO-MILLED CLUBFACEdelivers excellent spin, control and stability whether in the fairway, on the fringe or on the green. Use 3 clubs around the green instead of one<div></div>  - PROFESSIONAL QUALITY AT A GREAT VALUEOur right-handed bunker wedges are crafted with top-of-the-line manufacturing techniques and designed for the average golfer, weekend warrior, or amateur golfer like you, offering high-end performance at an affordable price to enhance your short game</div></div></div></center><center><div><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"height:10px\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></center><center><div><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"height:10px\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></center><center><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src='data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mP8/x8AAwMCAO+ip1sAAAAASUVORK5CYII=' data-src=\"https://gi.esmplus.com/epep5524/%ED%95%98%EB%8B%A8.png\"  style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" /></div></center><span></span>",
  "text": "골프 웨지 세트 525660도 클럽 남녀용 샌드 피칭 남성용 오른손용 선물 색상\nDescription\nSports & Outdoors:Sports:Golf:Golf Clubs:Wedges\nGOODS SPECIFICS\n- Size : Right Handed, 52,56,60 set\n- Color : Silver/Turquoise\n- Golf Club Flex : Regular\n- Hand Orientation : Right\n- Golf Club Loft : 525660 Degrees\n- Material : Steel\n- Brand : T WINSOLOGY\n- Shaft Material : Steel\n- Item Weight : 1.2 Kilograms\n- Grip Material : Synthetic Rubber\n- Grip Type : standard synthetic rubber grip\n- Golf Club Type : Wedge Golf Club\n- Included Components : NO\n- Manufacturer : T WINSOLOGY\n- Item Package Dimensions L x W x H : 36.8 x 5 x 3.4 inches\n- Package Weight : 1.45 Kilograms\n- Brand Name : T WINSOLOGY\n- Warranty Description : NO\n- Model Name : Golf Wedges Set\n- Suggested Users : unisex-adult\nFeature\n- SET OF WEDGESFull set of 3 golf clubs with 52, 56 and 60 degree lofts, precision CNC machined with micro-grooves on the face for superior spin performance. The spiral pattern also helps to remove moisture and debris from the club face\n- EXCELLENT DURABILITY：Forging and CNC-look technology add to the durability of the face, making it more resistant to wear than other wedges, even in wet bunkers and on grass\n- EXCELLENT FEELT WINSOLOGY bunker wedges feature a stepped shaft design combined with a non-slip grip that greatly reduces vibration and provides accurate feedback at impact. This ensures you feel confident with every swing\n- MICRO-MILLED CLUBFACEdelivers excellent spin, control and stability whether in the fairway, on the fringe or on the green. Use 3 clubs around the green instead of one\n- PROFESSIONAL QUALITY AT A GREAT VALUEOur right-handed bunker wedges are crafted with top-of-the-line manufacturing techniques and designed for the average golfer, weekend warrior, or amateur golfer like you, offering high-end performance at an affordable price to enhance your short game",
